---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Partner with us"
  description="Universities, charities, support services and funders: work with Lockstep to help people reduce gambling and stay in control."
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Partner with us" title="Let's help more people regain control, together">
    <p>
      We work with organisations that share our goal: helping people reduce gambling by
      redirecting urges towards healthier, real-world alternatives.
    </p>
    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="button" href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Partnering%20with%20Lockstep`}>
        Email us about partnering
      </a>
    </div>
  </PageHero>

  <section class="section section--surface" aria-labelledby="universities-heading">
    <div class="container stack reveal">
      <h2 id="universities-heading">Universities and colleges</h2>
      <p>
        Offer students a practical, judgement-free tool that sits alongside your existing
        wellbeing and student support services.
      </p>
      <p>
        For many people, gambling starts at university, alongside sport, nights out and group
        chats. Lockstep gives students somewhere to turn early, long before things reach a
        crisis. Working together could include:
      </p>
      <ul class="points">
        <li>Introducing Lockstep to students through your wellbeing team, students' union and welcome events</li>
        <li>Running a pilot with a group of students and learning from their feedback</li>
        <li>Connecting Lockstep with your existing support, so students who need more help know where to go</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We never share information about individual students.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="charities-heading">
    <div class="container stack reveal">
      <h2 id="charities-heading">Charities and support services</h2>
      <p>
        Prevention and treatment work best together. We want to help people find the right
        support at the right time, and to learn from organisations already doing this work.
      </p>
      <p>We'd like to work with you on:</p>
      <ul class="points">
        <li>
          <strong>Meetings:</strong> listing your support groups in Lockstep, so people can find
          meetings that fit their situation
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Referrals:</strong> pointing people who need more help towards your services,
          and offering a lighter-touch option to people who aren't ready for formal treatment
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Co-design and research:</strong> shaping new features with the people you
          support, and sharing what we learn
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--surface" id="funders" aria-labelledby="funders-heading">
    <div class="container stack reveal">
      <h2 id="funders-heading">Funders and supporters</h2>
      <p>
        Your support helps us build and test Lockstep with the people who use it, and measure
        what really makes a difference.
      </p>
      <p>Lockstep is at an early stage. Funding would help us:</p>
      <ul class="points">
        <li>Develop and test new features with the people who use them</li>
        <li>Reach more people earlier, before gambling becomes a crisis</li>
        <li>Measure our impact properly, and share what we find</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        If you'd like to hear more about our plans, we'd be glad to talk.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="international-heading">
    <div class="container stack reveal">
      <h2 id="international-heading">Organisations outside the UK</h2>
      <p>
        Gambling harm isn't only a UK problem. We're looking to bring Lockstep to new countries
        by working with NGOs and public agencies that already know their communities.
      </p>
      <p>
        We provide the app and adapt it for each country, from language to local support
        services and meetings. Our partners lead how it reaches people locally.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--surface" aria-labelledby="partner-cta-heading">
    <div class="container stack reveal">
      <h2 id="partner-cta-heading">Start a conversation</h2>
      <p>
        Tell us a little about your organisation and what you have in mind. We'll get back to
        you. You can also write to us directly at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a class="button" href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Partnering%20with%20Lockstep`}>
          Email us about partnering
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .points {
    padding-left: 1.25em;
  }

  .points li + li {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xs);
  }
</style>
